Can you speak briefly to why faceting is not likely to be supported by ggvis (except in the form of embedded plots)? Is it just going to be so easy to create multiple plots that you don't feel like it needs to be explicitly supported by the syntax, or have you had a philosophical shift away from faceted plots?

